---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | Landscaping Murrieta, CA"
  description="Locally-owned landscaping company serving Murrieta since 2011. Drought-smart design, HOA expertise, and full-service installation and maintenance for Temecula Valley homeowners."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-primary text-white py-20 px-4 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About Landscaping Murrieta</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Transforming Yards Since 2011</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-8 text-center">Our Story</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-primary">
      <p>
        Landscaping Murrieta was founded in 2011 by a Murrieta resident who saw a real gap in the local
        market: homeowners in the Temecula Valley needed a landscaping partner who genuinely understood
        the region — its clay-heavy soils, intense summer heat, strict water conservation requirements,
        and the patchwork of HOA guidelines that vary from one community to the next. Cookie-cutter
        solutions from national franchises simply don't work here. We were built from day one to be
        the alternative.
      </p>
      <p>
        We started with residential lawn care — reliable, consistent maintenance for Murrieta homeowners
        who were tired of unreliable contractors. As our reputation grew, so did our capabilities.
        We expanded into full landscape design and installation, irrigation systems, and seasonal
        yard cleanups. Today, we handle everything from a quick biweekly lawn maintenance visit to
        complete backyard transformations — all with the same locally-rooted team that's been serving
        this community since the beginning.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over fifteen years, we've landscaped hundreds of properties across Murrieta, Temecula, Wildomar,
        and the surrounding valley. We've earned the trust of homeowners in Bear Creek, Greer Ranch,
        Copper Canyon, and dozens of other neighborhoods by doing the work right the first time,
        staying honest about costs, and treating every yard as if it were our own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why We're Different -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-12">Why We're Different</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 004 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">Drought-Smart Design</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We're specialists in California-native and drought-adapted plants that thrive in Murrieta's
            hot, dry summers without excessive water. We're also familiar with rebate programs offered
            through EVMWD and RCWD, so you can offset costs when you upgrade to water-efficient plants
            or irrigation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">HOA Expertise</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We know the landscape guidelines for Murrieta's most active HOA communities — including
            Bear Creek, Greer Ranch, Copper Canyon, and others throughout the valley. We prepare all
            required documentation and submit on your behalf, so you don't have to navigate the
            approval process alone.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">Full Service</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Design, installation, irrigation, and ongoing maintenance — one team, one relationship.
            You'll never have to coordinate between multiple contractors or explain your vision
            twice. We handle the full scope of your yard from the first sketch to every biweekly
            maintenance visit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Team -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-8">Our Team</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      Our crew is made up of certified landscapers and irrigation specialists who live and work in
      the Murrieta area. They know the difference between the soil in Greer Ranch and the soil in
      Wildomar. They know which plants struggle in afternoon western exposure and which thrive.
      Every team member is trained in California water conservation practices and HOA compliance
      requirements specific to the Temecula Valley. When you work with us, you're working with
      people who actually know your neighborhood.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Credentials -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Licensed, Insured & Compliant</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Licensed & Insured</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">California contractor's license with full liability and workers' compensation coverage on every job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Water District Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Familiar with EVMWD and RCWD regulations, including watering schedules, rebate programs, and conservation mandates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Code-Compliant Work</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">All installations meet local building and landscape codes. Irrigation systems include required backflow prevention as mandated by California law.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Area -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Our Service Area</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
      We serve homeowners throughout the Temecula Valley and surrounding communities in Riverside County.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      {['Murrieta', 'Temecula', 'Wildomar', 'Menifee', 'Lake Elsinore', 'Canyon Lake', 'Winchester', 'Hemet', 'Perris'].map(city => (
        <span class="bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20 rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium">{city}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-primary py-16 px-4 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready for a Beautiful Yard? Let's Talk.</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg mb-8">Free consultations for all landscaping, lawn care, irrigation, and cleanup projects in Murrieta and surrounding areas.</p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-white text-primary font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"
      >
        Schedule a Free Consultation
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <LeadForm heading="Or Fill Out the Form — We'll Be in Touch" />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
